{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059904/block/singleImage/3246443/df/01M5KA1HVMQ6JA9ZXYTJ4QPJPR.png?updatedAt=1792723202\"/><figcaption>元朗警區特別職務隊入境處人員打擊非法賣淫活動行動。行動中共拘捕24名內地女子(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗警區特別職務隊入境處人員周四（22日）於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。行動中共拘捕24名內地女子，年齡介乎27至57歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。 元朗警區表示會繼續加大力度，打擊區內賣淫等非法活動。警方呼籲市民，若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，請與警方聯絡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.953058+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:58:07.986481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:05.432989+00:00","content_hash":"04b4cba5c5875e05d1b15f82f74715f268f9ebdb2f1364b6e0b503fe87670bde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}